# elavtirips — PUBLIC payload repo. It must contain ONLY encrypted .enc blobs.
#
# Whitelist pattern: ignore EVERYTHING, then re-allow directories so git can descend,
# plus .enc payloads and a couple of known meta files. Consequence: a stray secret
# (a ship SQL carrying the plaintext AES key, a raw .dll, release notes, etc.) placed
# anywhere in this repo can NEVER be accidentally `git add`ed or pushed to the public.
*
!*/
!*.enc
!.gitignore
!README.md
!.gitkeep
